1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[tense music playing]

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
[narrator] The Hunters
have entered the palace

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
in order to exterminate
the Chimera Ant King.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
I guess my attacks
don't affect it at all.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
What is that damn thing?

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,000
[chuckles]

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Don't run away! Answer me!

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,000
What is this?

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,000
[narrator] To spare the injured Shoot

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
and to draw
Youpi's attention to himself,

11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Knuckle began
to taunt him mercilessly.

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
[dramatic music playing]

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
[roaring]

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
[Meleoron] Damn!
Knuckle's planning to fight Youpi alone,

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
and I can't get to him,

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
not through that deadly,
sword-like onslaught.

17
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
There's no way!

18
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
In that case…

19
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,000
[Shoot] No. I can't pass out,

20
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
not now.

21
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
If I do,

22
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,000
[groans]

23
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:04,000
…still keep going.

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
[Meleoron] Right now,
my job isn't to help him.

25
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,000
[sobs]

26
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
No matter how much I want to!

27
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:23,000
My job is to use my power
to help the others

28
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,000
to complete the mission
as fast as possible.

29
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
[narrator] Though it broke his heart,

30
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Meanwhile, Ikalgo proceeded
further into the palace

31
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,000
[Ikalgo] Satellite Dragonflies.

32
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Any friend of theirs
is a friend of mine.

33
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,000
[narrator] Morel was first
to reach the throne room,

34
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
and he waited to continue
his battle with Pouf,

35
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Gon and Killua
located their target, Neferpitou,

36
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,000
all for the purpose
of avenging their friend, Kite.

37
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

38
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,000
[singer singing in English]

39
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

40
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:13,000
[singer singing in English]

41
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

42
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,000
[singer singing in English]

43
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

44
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,000
REVENGE X AND X RECOVERY

45
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,000
Do you…

46
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
remember who I am?

47
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
And I came here for one reason,

48
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
to make you restore Kite!

49
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Pitou's defenseless,

50
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,000
might as well be completely naked.

51
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Does Pitou think we're beatable…

52
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
without using aura?

53
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:34,000
Nobody can fight that naked,
not even Pitou.

54
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,000
But if that's the case,

55
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,000
why doesn't it look that way?

56
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
[suspenseful music playing]

57
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:56,000
It almost looks like…

58
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
That's it!

59
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,000
protecting the weak from a predator.

60
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:12,000
But that's ridiculous.

61
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
No way Pitou's capable of that.

62
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
[Killua] Why was he so cryptic?

63
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[gasps]

64
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:42,000
conjuring images in his mind
of his broken friend, Kite.

65
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,000
[rattling]

66
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,000
so come and fight me!

67
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,000
[gasps]

68
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,000
[panting]

69
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,000
Get up! We're going outside!

70
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,000
[narrator] Gon needed
an outlet for his rage,

71
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:46,000
but with Pitou being
so unexpectedly submissive,

72
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,000
he had none.

73
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:51,000
Meanwhile, Killua was
starting to understand

74
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,000
what was going on. It was…

75
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:59,000
[Zeno] I know nothing
beyond the mission I was given.

76
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:15,000
his mission was probably to use
Dragon Dive and Dragon Head

77
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:18,000
to get the King and his Royal Guards
away from each other,

78
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,000
Pitou's healing her
on the King's orders.

79
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,000
when it's being used.

80
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
[narrator] But as important
as this information was,

81
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,000
[Killua] What do I do?
What should I say?

82
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,000
-Gon!
-I'll do anything!

83
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
[Neferpitou gasps]

84
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:36,000
I'll do anything
you want me to do,

85
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:41,000
but you have to wait, because I…

86
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
[gasps]

87
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:33,000
[narrator] Pitou didn't know
what to say in this situation,

88
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:49,000
[narrator] The truth,
plain and simple.

89
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:54,000
[Neferpitou] Because of her,
the King became who he is today.

90
00:13:55,000 --> 00:14:00,000
If she ceases to exist, the King
will cease to be who he is.

91
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:11,000
I beg you to let me heal her,

92
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:14,000
and then I'll do
anything you ask of me,

93
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,000
so please just wait.

94
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:24,000
[Gon] You want to save her life?

95
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,000
You're telling me that you really…

96
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
want to save this girl's life?

97
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:38,000
[Gon shuddering]

98
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:55,000
How dare you… say that?

99
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:07,000
Damn it! Why, you…

100
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,000
probably because of us…

101
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:30,000
and Grandpa's Dragon Dive.

102
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,000
[Gon] And?

103
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:35,000
[Killua] And Pitou's likely healing her.

104
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:38,000
Well, that's what it looks like, anyway.

105
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,000
[Gon] So?

106
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,000
Hold off.

107
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,000
Wait until it's done.

108
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,000
[Gon] "Likely"? "Probably"?

109
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,000
"Probably"? "Likely"?

110
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,000
For real?

111
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,000
The hell with that!

112
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,000
Quit messing around!

113
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,000
[Gon panting]

114
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:16,000
[shouts] What the hell's
the matter with you?

115
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,000
Because there's no way in hell!

116
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,000
[arm cracks]

117
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,000
[both gasp]

118
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,000
[dramatic music playing]

119
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,000
[angelic choir singing]

120
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:43,000
[Neferpitou] If you like,
I'll break my right arm as well,

121
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,000
and if that's not enough…

122
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,000
then I'll break my legs.

123
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,000
[Neferpitou whimpers]

124
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,000
If you truly think that
I won't keep my promise

125
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,000
after I heal her,

126
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,000
you can mangle my body
all you want,

127
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:08,000
as long as it doesn't
hinder my ability to treat her.

128
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,000
[chorus continues]

129
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,000
[grunts]

130
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,000
[shuddering]

131
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,000
[shudders]

132
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:08,000
I want you to tell me!

133
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:54,000
[gasps]

134
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,000
[Gon] Show me--

135
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:59,000
[Killua] No. You kill Pitou,

136
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,000
Must be real nice for you.

137
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:51,000
I'm only saying this,
because it looks like you're losing it.

138
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:55,000
Did you forget what you told me
in the very beginning?

139
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,000
We're here to get Kite back.

140
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Get it together, damn it!

141
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:15,000
Okay.

142
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:18,000
I've calmed down now.

143
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:40,000
For how long?
How long should we wait?

144
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,000
[gasps]

145
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:45,000
Uh, I estimate it will take
three to four hours

146
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:47,000
to heal her completely.

147
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:37,000
I'll wait right here for one hour.

148
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
[closing theme music playing]

149
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:14,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

150
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:32,000
[upbeat music playing]

151
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Killua] I kind of feel better now.
